{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134690/extras/dd99c449b2eaf6e03220e5f31291ad09.poster.avif?t=1772046869\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134690/extras/dd99c449b2eaf6e03220e5f31291ad09.webm?t=1772046869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134690/extras/dd99c449b2eaf6e03220e5f31291ad09.mp4?t=1772046869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LET BLOOD BE SHED!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world as you knew it is gone, replaced by a twisted and violent hellscape. You've been injected with a psychoactive drug, and your mind and body are barely holding together. Fight your way through the chaos and emerge alive, if you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KILL OR BE KILLED</strong><br>In this brutal fight for survival, there's no room for mercy or hesitation. You'll have to wield every weapon at your disposal and butcher your way through hordes of enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEATH IS INEVITABLE</strong><br>Get ready to die - a lot. Every misstep could be your last. But with each death comes the opportunity to learn and improve, inching closer to victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ARM YOURSELF TO THE TEETH</strong><br>From a nail gun to a deadly shotgun, you'll have to gather an arsenal of weapons to face your enemies. Each shot counts, and every weapon could be your last hope.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT TO SURVIVE</strong><br>Time is running out, and your body is slowly shutting down. You'll need to rely on your adrenaline and quick reflexes to stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEED A DOSE?</strong><br>Find and use different injections throughout the game to enhance your abilities. Whether you need a health boost or increased agility, these shots might be your only hope.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CRAFT YOUR OWN DEATHTRAPS</strong><br>Get creative and design your own deadly levels with the custom editor. Add your favorite music and share your creation with the world. The bloodbath doesn't have to end.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2134690?t=1772046869","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134690/c2e308dffbdf5e58b2c859fbd5d7d69b5ecdb13f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772046869","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134690/f1c770b79a1002837572c0a9b890c612089814fc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772046869","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134690/f1c770b79a1002837572c0a9b890c612089814fc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772046869","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2306290,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134690/extras/dd99c449b2eaf6e03220e5f31291ad09.poster.avif?t=1772046869\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134690/extras/dd99c449b2eaf6e03220e5f31291ad09.webm?t=1772046869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134690/extras/dd99c449b2eaf6e03220e5f31291ad09.mp4?t=1772046869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LET BLOOD BE SHED!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world as you knew it is gone, replaced by a twisted and violent hellscape. You've been injected with a psychoactive drug, and your mind and body are barely holding together. Fight your way through the chaos and emerge alive, if you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KILL OR BE KILLED</strong><br>In this brutal fight for survival, there's no room for mercy or hesitation. You'll have to wield every weapon at your disposal and butcher your way through hordes of enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEATH IS INEVITABLE</strong><br>Get ready to die - a lot. Every misstep could be your last. But with each death comes the opportunity to learn and improve, inching closer to victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ARM YOURSELF TO THE TEETH</strong><br>From a nail gun to a deadly shotgun, you'll have to gather an arsenal of weapons to face your enemies. Each shot counts, and every weapon could be your last hope.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT TO SURVIVE</strong><br>Time is running out, and your body is slowly shutting down. You'll need to rely on your adrenaline and quick reflexes to stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEED A DOSE?</strong><br>Find and use different injections throughout the game to enhance your abilities. Whether you need a health boost or increased agility, these shots might be your only hope.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CRAFT YOUR OWN DEATHTRAPS</strong><br>Get creative and design your own deadly levels with the custom editor. Add your favorite music and share your creation with the world. The bloodbath doesn't have to end.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p>","developers":["ButterCorp"],"dlc":[4367090],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134690/6506aa4b63e169ac19df1db506c7354921e0da05/header.jpg?t=1772046869","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2134690/1573147730/2f810a7b59c176f36de94e79095f08193cc78f08/1758632642/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758634834","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2134690/1573147730/2f810a7b59c176f36de94e79095f08193cc78f08/1758632642/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758634834","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2134690/1573147730/2f810a7b59c176f36de94e79095f08193cc78f08/1758632642/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758634834","id":257204673,"name":"INJECTION Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257204673/3bd61ec164eba67979d01ea3465150483330839b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758634834"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2134690/616513/ee86e6a6d0498b69a1c0422e61841a5e2048f92d/1751080322/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754564147","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2134690/616513/ee86e6a6d0498b69a1c0422e61841a5e2048f92d/1751080322/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754564147","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2134690/616513/ee86e6a6d0498b69a1c0422e61841a5e2048f92d/1751080322